DESCRIPTION:MANGO is a delicious showcase of women\, trans and non-binary c
 omedians\, serving up a comedy feast you won't want to miss. For this speci
 al Fringe edition of the four-time Chortle Award-winning night (Open Comedy
 \, Leith)\, we've handpicked some of our absolute favourites from across th
 e Scottish comedy scene. Expect razor-sharp stand-up\, big laughs\, unforge
 ttable performances and an eclectic mix of comic voices. This juicy platter
  of talent promises laughter\, surprises and plenty of reasons to come back
  for seconds. Proceeds will go to Breast Cancer Now in support of Kathleen 
 Hughes.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/mango-comedy
 /
